    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just stress though. it's like, i can see it in their eyes when i walk into a room. they're just tired of dealing with me. i feel like a constant drain on everyone i love, and the more i try to fix it, the more i just break things. i hate that i'm such a burden.",
